-- The areas of Dragon Ball Super Card Game Fusion World, as declarations.
--
-- Cut down from the dbs file of the same name (F1-02). The manual's seven
-- areas (FW manual p. 5) are the Leader, Deck, Battle, Combo, Energy, Drop and
-- Life Areas; there is no Z-Deck, Z-Energy, Unison or Warp Area, so those four
-- declarations are gone. Three more are declared because a program has to be
-- able to name them: `removed` (an energy marker or a card removed from the
-- game, FW manual p. 8), `under` (cards beneath another card) and `play`, the
-- word for the areas in which a card is in play. Each says so in its own text.
--
-- The conventions are the dbs file's: `ordered: true` is an order the rules
-- fix, `visibility` is `none` (a secret nobody reads), `owner` or `all`, and
-- `place` is whether the zone is a list of cards a player holds (`play` and
-- `under` are not). Each player has one of every area; none is shared.

DEFINE ZONE deck                                                          -- FW manual p. 5, Deck Area
  owner: player
  visibility: none
  ordered: true
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: false
  host: false
  place: true
  text: "the deck, face down: neither player may check its contents or change its order (FW manual p. 5, Deck Area)"

DEFINE ZONE hand                                                          -- FW manual p. 6, setup step 3
  owner: player
  visibility: owner
  ordered: false
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: false
  host: false
  place: true
  text: "the cards a player holds: their own to read and reorder, and no limit on how many (FW manual p. 6, setup step 3)"

DEFINE ZONE drop                                                          -- FW manual p. 5, Drop Area
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: false
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: false
  host: false
  place: true
  text: "where KO'd Battle Cards and used Extra Cards are placed, face up (FW manual p. 5, Drop Area)"

DEFINE ZONE leader                                                        -- FW manual p. 5, Leader Area
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: false
  single: true
  markers: false
  inPlay: true
  host: true
  place: true
  modes: [active, rest]
  text: "the one Leader Card, face up, which no effect or rule may move out of this area (FW manual p. 5, Leader Area)"

DEFINE ZONE battle                                                        -- FW manual p. 5, Battle Area
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: false
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: true
  host: true
  place: true
  modes: [active, rest]
  text: "where Battle Cards are played, in Active Mode, with no limit on how many (FW manual p. 5, Battle Area)"

DEFINE ZONE combo                                                         -- FW manual p. 5, Combo Area
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: false
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: false
  host: true
  place: true
  text: "the Battle Cards used in a combo, face up; their combo power is added to the card in battle (FW manual p. 5, Combo Area)"

DEFINE ZONE energy                                                        -- FW manual p. 5, Energy Area
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: false
  single: false
  markers: true
  inPlay: false
  host: false
  place: true
  modes: [active, rest]
  text: "the energy a player pays costs with, face up and active, and where energy markers are kept (FW manual p. 5, Energy Area; p. 8 for the marker)"

DEFINE ZONE life                                                          -- FW manual p. 5, Life Area
  owner: player
  visibility: none
  ordered: true
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: false
  host: false
  place: true
  text: "the Leader's life, face down: its order may not be changed, but any card may be chosen when one leaves (FW manual p. 5, Life Area; p. 6, setup step 4)"

DEFINE ZONE removed                                                       -- FW manual p. 8
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: false
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: false
  host: false
  place: true
  text: "cards removed from the game: face up, visible to all, and in no area of the game at all (FW manual p. 8: a marker spent on a cost is removed from the game)"

DEFINE ZONE under                                                         -- FW manual p. 5
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: true
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: false
  host: false
  place: false
  text: "the cards beneath another card, face up and skills negated; the area they count as being in is the area of the card on top (FW manual p. 5)"

DEFINE ZONE play                                                          -- FW manual p. 5
  owner: player
  visibility: all
  ordered: false
  single: false
  markers: false
  inPlay: true
  host: false
  place: false
  text: "not a place a card is put: the word for the Leader and Battle Areas together, the areas a card's own skills are valid in (FW manual p. 5)"
